## Planned Features and System Status

### Roadmap Features

The global search input, along with Calendar, Meals, Groceries, Health, Activities, Birthdays, Events, Vacations, Work/Study, and Notes sections, are planned for upcoming releases.

Whenever a section displays the **Module unavailable** placeholder, it indicates the interface is prepared while backend services await implementation. The application never generates fabricated data.

### System Availability and Maintenance

If the server undergoes maintenance or network connectivity drops:

- The app displays an intuitive status page with real-time feedback and a reconnect retry button.
- Application documentation at `/documentation` remains completely accessible even while backend services are offline.
